<p class="help-foot">
<span class="k">j</span>
<span class="k">k</span> move (a folded group is skipped) · <span class="k">Tab</span> other list · <span class="k">Enter</span> open · <span class="k">r</span>
<span class="k">x</span>
<span class="k">i</span>
<span class="k">c</span> act on the selected row · <span class="k">v</span> reviewers · <span class="k">d</span> details · <span class="k">X</span> archived · <span class="k">?</span> all keys</p>
